Build on Windows from a case-sensitive file system with a non-Windows shell:
include <windows.h> as MinGW names it, and copy with `cmake -E copy`
instead of the cmd.exe builtin `copy`. Not yet submitted upstream.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
